  "post_content": "<p>El Casal Jove de Onda acoge desde el martes a este s&aacute;bado el concurso de palomos de raza. La exposici&oacute;n est&aacute; abierta todos los d&iacute;as de 16 a 20 horas y el s&aacute;bado por la ma&ntilde;ana se realizar&aacute; el enjuiciamiento final y la entrega de premios.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/12/IMG_1324.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El concurso est&aacute; organizado por el&nbsp;Club de Palomos de Raza La Plana, que preside la ondense Conch&iacute;n Irigaray.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concursopalomosraza/img_1310.jpg\" alt=\"img_1310\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concursopalomosraza/img_1311.jpg\" alt=\"img_1311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concursopalomosraza/img_1312.jpg\" alt=\"img_1312\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concursopalomosraza/img_1313.jpg\" alt=\"img_1313\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concursopalomosraza/img_1314.jpg\" alt=\"img_1314\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concursopalomosraza/img_1315.jpg\" alt=\"img_1315\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concursopalomosraza/img_1316.jpg\" alt=\"img_1316\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concursopalomosraza/img_1317.jpg\" alt=\"img_1317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concursopalomosraza/